license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/cagrisa-creator/pcr3bp-fiber-elimination"
keywords:
  - restricted three-body problem
  - Levi-Civita regularization
  - strict convexity
  - convexity gates
  - computer-assisted proof
  - numerical reconnaissance
abstract: >-
  This package accompanies a revised manuscript on exact fiber elimination for
  the Levi-Civita convexity gates of the planar circular restricted three-body
  problem. For fixed parameters, the regularized surface is tested over a
  three-dimensional domain: a two-dimensional Levi-Civita base and a fiber
  angle. The tangential gate has an exact two-variable fiber minimum, while the
  determinant gate has an exact harmonic decomposition giving a rigorous
  sufficient two-variable lower bound. The package also contains a numerical
  Earth-Moon spot check and a floating-point global reconnaissance; these
  numerical components are not interval certificates unless explicitly stated
  otherwise.
